== D2: Observation FAN-5 second half, Qwen's own inductive route ==
  claim: [L]^(L+1), 2  clears in exactly L steps, for every L >= 2
  step : [L]^(L+1), 2  ->  [L-1]^L, 2   (one HH step)
  L=2..40 : direct simulation AND induction step both hold in 39/39 cases
